      "conversation_id": 191,
      "text": "TrustShare uses server-side AES-256-GCM encryption with a separate per-file key protected by a master key. Authorized processing decrypts files in server memory. This is not end-to-end or zero-knowledge encryption; the server can decrypt authorized content.",
