      },
      "conversation_id": 192,
      "text": "AI summaries extract readable text from .csv, .docx, .md, .pdf, .pptx, .txt, .xlsx, up to 20 MiB per file. Scanned image-only PDFs require OCR, which is not enabled. Summary lengths and paragraph/bullet formats are supported in the source language. Long sources use bounded excerpts with a visible coverage warning. The extractive fallback is labelled separately. Generated text can omit details or contain mistakes; verify important facts in the original. The configured summary model is qwen2.5:0.5b.",
      "question": "Which files support AI summary?"
